<title>USA: Orange Township, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Orange Township, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it won $5.675 million of Orange Township, N.J., school bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.925 percent.</p>
</text>
